# CSS & Tailwind Standards

- The core fluid configuration lives in `src/assets/css/input.css`.
- Do not overwrite `--fluid-min-width` or `--fluid-max-width` variables unless specifically requested.
- Maintain existing `--fluid-bp` calculations for responsive scaling.
- Keep custom CSS utilities clean and organized under standard Tailwind `@layer` directives if used.